=== Dispensers ===
[[Dispenser]]s can equip a carved pumpkin on a player, mob or [[armor stand]] with an empty helmet slot, within the block the dispenser is facing. It can also place the carved pumpkin as a block, if a snow, iron, or copper golem can be spawned after the pumpkin is placed.

